' User menu: F2 shows it. An item starts at the left margin, with
' its hot key, a colon and its title; its commands follow, each
' indented. In a command ! is the file under the cursor without its
' extension, !.! with it, !: the current drive and !\ the current
' directory.
D: Date and time
	date
	time
L: Directory listing
	dir !:!\
T: Type the file under the cursor
	type !.!
